---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="Leaking Pool in Spring, TX | Detection & Repair" description="Pool leak detection and repair in Spring, TX. Locate the source of water loss and stop it efficiently.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Leaking Pool</h1><p>Stop water loss and protect your structure and budget.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>Pools lose water to evaporation, but a steady drop below normal levels usually means a leak in the equipment, plumbing, or shell. Early detection saves money and prevents larger damage.</p>
    <h2>How We Find Leaks</h2>
    <ul><li>Bucket test to confirm abnormal loss</li><li>Pressure testing of lines</li><li>Dye testing around fittings</li><li>Equipment pad inspection</li><li>Electronic methods when needed</li></ul>
    <p>Once located, we provide clear repair options and pricing so you can decide with confidence.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Find the Leak</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
